      "outputDir": "dist",
      "branch": "main",
      "description": "Astro 博客，构建型，无后端绑定",
      "bindings": [],
      "patches": ["disable-rss-route", "disable-sitemap", "tolerate-partial-build"],
      "patchesNote": "上游 @astrojs/rss 与 @astrojs/sitemap 都与 zod 4 不兼容，会让构建崩溃；禁用这两个集成"
